type: dataset
title: "AI Governance Engineering: The Thesis & Body of Knowledge"
abstract: >-
  The founding text and working reference for AI governance engineering: turning AI governance
  obligations into policy-as-code, eval gates and machine-readable evidence. Jorge García Aibar is
  the author of the Body of Knowledge, website, datasets and project materials. The Thesis is the
  sole exception and is co-authored by Jorge García Aibar and Aurélie Pols.
